Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English!

3
00:00:10.066 --> 00:00:13.477
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.527 --> 00:00:17.306
Today we learn: My Neighborhood. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.548 --> 00:00:22.182
Neighborhood. Say it with me. Neighborhood!

6
00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:29.090
Resident. Say it with me. Resident!

7
00:00:32.566 --> 00:00:36.082
Landmark. Say it with me. Landmark!

8
00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:43.917
Convenience store. Say it with me. Convenience store!

9
00:00:47.421 --> 00:00:50.838
Crowded. Say it with me. Crowded!

10
00:00:54.379 --> 00:00:58.012
Peaceful. Say it with me. Peaceful!

11
00:01:01.522 --> 00:01:05.139
Nearby. Say it with me. Nearby!

12
00:01:08.606 --> 00:01:13.056
Public transport. Say it with me. Public transport!

13
00:01:16.567 --> 00:01:20.417
Intersection. Say it with me. Intersection!

14
00:01:23.882 --> 00:01:28.565
Community center. Say it with me. Community center!

15
00:01:32.061 --> 00:01:35.227
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

16
00:01:38.757 --> 00:01:41.957
Modern. Say it with me. Modern!

17
00:01:45.497 --> 00:01:56.349
Grammar time! There is / There are + adjectives. Listen. There is a peaceful park. There are many residents nearby.

18
00:01:56.399 --> 00:02:02.958
Your turn. Say it with me. There is a peaceful park. There are many residents nearby.

19
00:02:08.003 --> 00:02:15.932
My neighborhood is peaceful, with a convenience store nearby. There is a community center where residents often gather.

20
00:02:15.982 --> 00:02:17.462
I like this story!

21
00:02:18.664 --> 00:02:23.909
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:23.959 --> 00:02:25.109
Landmark!

23
00:02:26.183 --> 00:02:31.362
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:31.412 --> 00:02:32.562
Nearby!

25
00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:41.530
Think and answer. What do you like most about your neighborhood?

26
00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.730
Great answer!

27
00:02:43.877 --> 00:02:49.300
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
